  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8231820",
      "title": "A First Component & Some State",
      "sourceHash": "3517ad3c0832b83a7ec071e1ddb62e8624621644e91b25d90ab8a4fd7a6f3c28",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 1.83,
          "en": "So let's get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.83,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "with building this quiz project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 8.82,
          "en": "And I will get started by adding a couple of components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.82,
          "end": 10.74,
          "en": "Therefore, as a first step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.74,
          "end": 13.917,
          "en": "I'll add this Components folder in the SRC folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.917,
          "end": 17.22,
          "en": "And in there I want to add a Header JSX file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.22,
          "end": 22.22,
          "en": "to hold the header, which I want to show on top of my page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.35,
          "end": 25.41,
          "en": "And I'll add a Quiz.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.41,
          "end": 28.23,
          "en": "because as you saw before in this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.23,
          "end": 29.91,
          "en": "in this section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.91,
          "end": 32.67,
          "en": "we're going to build a quiz web app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.67,
          "end": 35.4,
          "en": "And therefore I'll add such a quiz component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.4,
          "end": 37.71,
          "en": "which will control this quiz",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.71,
          "end": 41.103,
          "en": "and render other quiz related Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.03,
          "end": 44.67,
          "en": "But I'll start with the header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.67,
          "end": 47.49,
          "en": "In there I'll add my header function component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.49,
          "end": 49.92,
          "en": "and of course also export it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.92,
          "end": 52.11,
          "en": "as you learned it before in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.11,
          "end": 55.47,
          "en": "and as we did it many times before in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.47,
          "end": 59.52,
          "en": "And then here I wanna return the built-in header element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.52,
          "end": 64.443,
          "en": "which should be wrapped around an image and an h1 element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.55,
          "end": 67.5,
          "en": "Now, in the h1 element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.5,
          "end": 71.16,
          "en": "which should display my main title on the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.16,
          "end": 73.037,
          "en": "I'll output ReactQuiz.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.037,
          "end": 78.037,
          "en": "And for the image, it's this quiz logo png file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.15,
          "end": 79.383,
          "en": "which I wanna display.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.67,
          "end": 83.46000000000001,
          "en": "And here's one important note, by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.46000000000001,
          "end": 87.45,
          "en": "Definitely feel free to pause these videos",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.45,
          "end": 90.81,
          "en": "at any point of time throughout this section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.81,
          "end": 94.113,
          "en": "to try out the next steps on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.58,
          "end": 96.72,
          "en": "So if I'm, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.72,
          "end": 98.88,
          "en": "saying that I want to display an image here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.88,
          "end": 100.47,
          "en": "and I tell you which image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.47,
          "end": 101.78999999999999,
          "en": "you can pause the video",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.78999999999999,
          "end": 104.49000000000001,
          "en": "and add the code for that on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.49000000000001,
          "end": 108.69,
          "en": "And the same is true for when I start adding new Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.69,
          "end": 111.99000000000001,
          "en": "or I start managing some state and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.99000000000001,
          "end": 115.62,
          "en": "Whenever I tell you that I'm about to do something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.62,
          "end": 117.9,
          "en": "definitely consider pausing the video",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.9,
          "end": 119.4,
          "en": "and trying it on your own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.4,
          "end": 122.853,
          "en": "because that will be a great exercise and practice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.38,
          "end": 129.03,
          "en": "So, here, to display this quiz logo png file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.03,
          "end": 131.37,
          "en": "I'll go back to the Header JSX file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.37,
          "end": 134.373,
          "en": "and import this logo image from.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.511,
          "end": 137.82,
          "en": "And then going up one level here, actually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.82,
          "end": 140.01,
          "en": "since I'm in the Components folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.01,
          "end": 142.32,
          "en": "then I'll dive into the assets folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.32,
          "end": 145.26,
          "en": "and then there it's this quiz logo png file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.26,
          "end": 146.493,
          "en": "which I wanna target.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.11,
          "end": 151.14,
          "en": "And with that import added, you learn before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.14,
          "end": 153.99,
          "en": "that in most React projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.99,
          "end": 156.75,
          "en": "this veet-based project included,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.75,
          "end": 159,
          "en": "I can set the source of the image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 159,
          "end": 161.34,
          "en": "to this imported image here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 161.34,
          "end": 163.92000000000002,
          "en": "and the project setup will then figure out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.92000000000002,
          "end": 167.16,
          "en": "and inject the path to the, potentially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.16,
          "end": 169.113,
          "en": "optimized image behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.61,
          "end": 172.89,
          "en": "Now we also want to add a alt text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.89,
          "end": 175.23,
          "en": "And here, I'll just say quiz logo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 175.23,
          "end": 177.813,
          "en": "You could of course be a bit more descriptive here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 179.22,
          "end": 181.62,
          "en": "With that, we got a very basic component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.62,
          "end": 183.42,
          "en": "no effects, no state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 183.42,
          "end": 186,
          "en": "because not all Components need that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 186,
          "end": 188.61,
          "en": "Indeed, most Components don't need state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 188.61,
          "end": 191.01,
          "en": "or don't need effects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 191.01,
          "end": 194.04,
          "en": "And therefore, now that we added this header component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 194.04,
          "end": 197.57999999999998,
          "en": "we can go to the app component file, the app JSX file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 197.57999999999998,
          "end": 202.57999999999998,
          "en": "and import header from ./components Header.jsx like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 205.14,
          "end": 209.943,
          "en": "And then simply return this custom header component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.32,
          "end": 212.85,
          "en": "And if you save everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.85,
          "end": 216.51,
          "en": "you should therefore then see this header here on the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.51,
          "end": 218.82,
          "en": "And that's of course a great first step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.82,
          "end": 221.88,
          "en": "but of course, also pretty basic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 221.88,
          "end": 224.34,
          "en": "Therefore, we'll continue right away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.34,
          "end": 227.223,
          "en": "and also start working on the quiz component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.96,
          "end": 231.48,
          "en": "Now my idea behind this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.48,
          "end": 234.21,
          "en": "is that in there I want to show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.21,
          "end": 238.32,
          "en": "the currently active question to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 238.32,
          "end": 241.83,
          "en": "And when the question was answered by the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 241.83,
          "end": 244.71,
          "en": "I wanna switch to a different question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.71,
          "end": 246.84,
          "en": "So it should be this quiz component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.84,
          "end": 251.19,
          "en": "that's responsible for switching between questions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 251.19,
          "end": 253.743,
          "en": "and registering user answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.94,
          "end": 256.71,
          "en": "But of course, I'll simply start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 256.71,
          "end": 261.12,
          "en": "by exporting a new component function, which is called Quiz.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 261.12,
          "end": 263.94,
          "en": "And then in this component, as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 263.94,
          "end": 267.03,
          "en": "I wanna output the question,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 267.03,
          "end": 270.87,
          "en": "so the Currently active Question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 270.87,
          "end": 273.36,
          "en": "And this, of course, will soon be replaced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 273.36,
          "end": 276.45,
          "en": "with more meaningful content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 276.45,
          "end": 277.40999999999997,
          "en": "That's the idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 277.40999999999997,
          "end": 279.81,
          "en": "And then, as mentioned, in this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279.81,
          "end": 284.07,
          "en": "I wanna manage what the currently active question is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 284.07,
          "end": 286.5,
          "en": "and I want to change to a different question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 286.5,
          "end": 289.32,
          "en": "whenever the user answers a question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 289.32,
          "end": 292.59000000000003,
          "en": "and I want to store those answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 292.59000000000003,
          "end": 297.39,
          "en": "Therefore, we'll definitely need to manage some state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 297.39,
          "end": 301.77,
          "en": "which we do with the useState hook imported from React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 301.77,
          "end": 305.973,
          "en": "because we need to register those answers, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 307.05,
          "end": 310.98,
          "en": "So, therefore, here we could add two pieces of state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 310.98,
          "end": 313.26,
          "en": "where the first piece of state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 313.26,
          "end": 316.8,
          "en": "is the currently active question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 316.8,
          "end": 318.87,
          "en": "And for that, let's simply assume",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 318.87,
          "end": 321.81,
          "en": "that we get an array of questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 321.81,
          "end": 324.99,
          "en": "I will soon provide you with some dummy data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 324.99,
          "end": 326.94,
          "en": "which will be such an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 326.94,
          "end": 330.09,
          "en": "And therefore the currently active question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 330.09,
          "end": 332.88,
          "en": "could simply be managed through the index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 332.88,
          "end": 335.31,
          "en": "of the currently active question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 335.31,
          "end": 337.35,
          "en": "If we got an array of questions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 337.35,
          "end": 339.27,
          "en": "we could simply manage the index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 339.27,
          "end": 342.06,
          "en": "of the currently displayed question here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 342.06,
          "end": 346.173,
          "en": "and change that index whenever the user answered a question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 347.94,
          "end": 351.255,
          "en": "So here we could then have the activeQuestionIndex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 351.255,
          "end": 355.83299999999997,
          "en": "and a setActiveQuestionIndex updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 357.81,
          "end": 360.54,
          "en": "That would be one way of managing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 360.54,
          "end": 363.633,
          "en": "which question should be displayed to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 364.74,
          "end": 368.28,
          "en": "And then, I'll also add a second piece of state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 368.28,
          "end": 373.28,
          "en": "where I wanna register the answers selected by the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 373.32,
          "end": 375.81,
          "en": "because every question will come",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 375.81,
          "end": 378.51,
          "en": "with multiple possible answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 378.51,
          "end": 381.33,
          "en": "And, of course, throughout the quiz,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 381.33,
          "end": 385.29,
          "en": "I wanna store all the answers picked by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 385.29,
          "end": 386.73,
          "en": "And therefore, we'll, well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 386.73,
          "end": 390.72,
          "en": "need some state where we do store those answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 390.72,
          "end": 393.33,
          "en": "And that could also be an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 393.33,
          "end": 397.383,
          "en": "where we basically just add answer by answer to this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 398.37,
          "end": 400.781,
          "en": "And I'll name this state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 400.781,
          "end": 405.22,
          "en": "userAnswers and setUserAnswers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 406.40999999999997,
          "end": 409.443,
          "en": "because these are the answers picked by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 411.03,
          "end": 412.98,
          "en": "But I can already tell you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 412.98,
          "end": 417.98,
          "en": "that this would be a possible way of managing the state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 418.08,
          "end": 421.923,
          "en": "but in my opinion, not necessarily the best way.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}